      "super-design prototypes"
    ],
    "actual_capabilities": [
      "Identifies prototype type from HTML, Figma export patterns, or super-design output paths.",
      "Detects project framework, TypeScript usage, and styling approach from project files.",
      "Breaks prototype layouts into atom, molecule, and organism component groups.",
      "Extracts color, typography, spacing, radius, shadow, and animation token structures.",
      "Provides React TypeScript component templates with props, refs, accessibility, and variants.",
      "Maps common HTML attributes and interactions to React and framework-specific patterns."
    ],
    "limitations": [
      "It provides guidance and templates, not a guaranteed automatic migration engine.",
      "Generated components still need review against the target design system.",
      "Complex animations, data flows, and business logic may require manual implementation.",
      "Non-React frameworks need adaptation from the documented default patterns."
    ],
    "use_cases": [
